{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q111381569","formula":"C₄₉H₇₁N₉O₁₆","hill":"C49H71N9O16","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":49.0,"H":71.0,"N":9.0,"O":16.0},"names":{"en":"Vipivotide tetraxetan","ru":"Випивотид тетраксетан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Vipivotide tetraxetan (also known as PSMA-617) is a radiopharmaceutical precursor molecule used in targeted therapies for prostate cancer and other tumors expressing prostate-specific membrane antigen (PSMA). PSMA-617 is a high-affinity inhibitor of the peptidase activity of PSMA, with a Ki of 0.37 nM. It consists of a PSMA-targeting moiety conjugated to a high-affinity chelator for metal isotopes. Its strong binding affinity for PSMA allows precise targeting of cancer cells that overexpress this protein, especially in prostate cancer."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":"C([C@H](NC(=O)[C@@H]1CC[C@@H](CNC(CN2CCN(CC(O)=O)CCN(CC(O)=O)CCN(CC(O)=O)CC2)=O)CC1)C(NCCCC[C@H](NC(N[C@@H](CCC(O)=O)C(O)=O)=O)C(O)=O)=O)C3=CC4=C(C=C3)C=CC=C4","inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":null,"atoms":145,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.697,"y":-4.424,"z":0.688,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.056,"y":-3.127,"z":0.152,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.645,"y":-2.964,"z":0.527,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.182,"y":-2.957,"z":1.823,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.921,"y":-3.092,"z":2.794,"el":"O"},{"x":0.327,"y":-2.757,"z":1.937,"el":"C"},{"x":0.808,"y":-2.974,"z":3.374,"el":"C"},{"x":2.33,"y":-2.86,"z":3.497,"el":"C"},{"x":2.953,"y":-1.75,"z":2.627,"el":"C"},{"x":3.71,"y":-2.356,"z":1.432,"el":"C"},{"x":4.432,"y":-1.351,"z":0.681,"el":"N"},{"x":4.782,"y":-1.556,"z":-0.636,"el":"C"},{"x":5.691,"y":-0.491,"z":-1.268,"el":"C"},{"x":6.631,"y":0.167,"z":-0.35,"el":"N"},{"x":7.649,"y":-0.676,"z":0.296,"el":"C"},